# Normalise line endings so a clone behaves the same on every machine.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites 260+ working files to CRLF on a
# Windows checkout while the objects stay LF. Anything that reads a file and
# matches on "\n" then silently misses — test/brand-skin.test.ts failing on a
# pristine checkout was exactly this.
* text=auto eol=lf
